# 特定关键字兜底 (移除容易误杀的 futu，保留特定专属词)
HOST-KEYWORD,futubull,Alpha
HOST-KEYWORD,moomoobull,Alpha
HOST-KEYWORD,futuniuniu,Alpha

# 核心服务域名 (后缀匹配，精确覆盖)
HOST-SUFFIX,futu.com,Alpha
HOST-SUFFIX,futu.cn,Alpha
HOST-SUFFIX,futu.link,Alpha
HOST-SUFFIX,futuhk.com,Alpha
HOST-SUFFIX,futuhk2.com,Alpha
