HOST-SUFFIX,futuchain.com,Alpha
HOST-SUFFIX,futustatic.com,Alpha
HOST-SUFFIX,moomoo.com,Alpha
# 匹配 futu0.com 到 futu9.com 等所有单数字子域名 (Quantumult X 支持正则，但为了兼容性保留 Keyword 或特定匹配)
HOST-KEYWORD,futu0,Alpha
HOST-KEYWORD,futu1,Alpha
HOST-KEYWORD,futu2,Alpha
HOST-KEYWORD,futu3,Alpha
HOST-KEYWORD,futu4,Alpha
HOST-KEYWORD,futu5,Alpha
